      "en": "Now these are the foundations which Solomon laid for the building of God’s house: the length by cubits after the first measure was sixty cubits, and the width twenty cubits.",
      "ko": "솔로몬이 하나님의 전을 위하여 놓은 지대는 이러하니 옛적 재는 법대로 장이 육십 규빗이요 광이 이십 규빗이며",
      "source_text_hash": "10f33558210d0c78b25384d4844d6c12adf06e3327f17aa6d560d71b85147806",
      "translation_text_hash": "c73caf8eb954df7abf0447475c0f0dfe96db685eb837fd581d3c55ce967c7526",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
