      "en": "The porch that was in front, its length, across the width of the house, was twenty cubits, and the height one hundred twenty; and he overlaid it within with pure gold.",
      "ko": "그 전 앞 낭실의 장이 전의 광과 같이 이십 규빗이요 고가 일백 이십 규빗이니 안에는 정금으로 입혔으며",
      "source_text_hash": "74481a912352b9de1122dc097c8287a6a174afafa1689478c6dea80de6151cc8",
      "translation_text_hash": "fb46c1ba067adf909a11e46543495eea971f6335bcd6b148f928e7a59eef4889",
