      "en": "He decorated the house with precious stones for beauty. The gold was gold from Parvaim.",
      "ko": "또 보석으로 전을 꾸며 화려하게 하였으니 그 금은 바르와임 금이며",
      "source_text_hash": "448d8c08770e4f98c712a7d70f4d49dc393e9a49c6b73094d4ca8066f115078a",
      "translation_text_hash": "a370adcf2fadd721483cb88591f03ad21de8f99b359988c79f856348418e3da0",
