      "en": "He also overlaid the house, the beams, the thresholds, its walls, and its doors with gold, and engraved cherubim on the walls.",
      "ko": "또 금으로 전과 그 들보와 문지방과 벽과 문짝에 입히고 벽에 그룹들을 아로새겼더라",
      "source_text_hash": "8be85e76b4fca993bb3f84c495f405699003ef100fa2726dad0634a2140062ef",
      "translation_text_hash": "a1c41ae9120009ccbf97df88597d056accadfd2d6dca94f9ab3de0ff86a52f7d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
