        {
          "book": "2CH",
          "chapter": 3,
          "verse": 8
        }
      ],
      "en": "He made the most holy place. Its length, according to the width of the house, was twenty cubits, and its width twenty cubits; and he overlaid it with fine gold, amounting to six hundred talents.",
      "ko": "또 지성소를 지었으니 전 넓이대로 장이 이십 규빗이요 광도 이십 규빗이라 정금 육백 달란트로 입혔으니",
      "source_text_hash": "012d0c683cc11cd4c8fa06aeb6aab345adb97cafd58fe3afb0362cc768317d01",
      "translation_text_hash": "edad07163087b78f308a6c46a475a775ee1508eb9763c669205b10ccdf2e5a7d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
